&lt;li&gt;Extended &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/radar/subresources/annotations/&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Annotations&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/radar/subresources/traffic_anomalies/&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Traffic Anomalies&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; APIs to support origin outages and anomalies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Radar - Add TLD insights</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/radar/release-notes/#add-tld-insights</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/radar/release-notes/#add-tld-insights</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
